# A makepkg run started in the checkout rather than the scratch directory
# RELEASING.md uses. Its working dirs are deliberately not listed: src/ and pkg/ are
# ordinary Go source directory names, and ignoring those repo-wide would silently
# drop real files from `git add -A`.
*.pkg.tar.zst

